|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| naive daily p < 0.05 | {{ PK.naive.declared_significant }} | {{ PK.naive.declared_but_final_does_not_support }} | {{ PK.naive.sign_reversals }} | {{ PK.naive.strong_reversals_final_significant_opposite }} | {{ PK.naive.detection_rate_among_final_significant|pct(0) }} |
