| *naive, model expectation (true effects from the fitted NPMLE prior)* | {{ MB.npmle_effects.declared|f(0) }} | {{ MB.npmle_effects.unsupported|f(0) }} | {{ MB.npmle_effects.sign_reversals|f(0) }} | | |
